      "decision": "Type-check gate runs via a pinned npx typescript in CI only: no dependencies, no devDependencies, no lockfile. typescript 7.x now ships platform-specific native optional deps, so a devDependency would import a real supply chain and a platform-sensitive lockfile into a repo whose zero-dependency property is explicit and CI-documented. Runtime supply chain stays at exactly zero; the gate still exists and CI still enforces it."
    },
