      "id": "A-12",
      "phase": "P4",
      "decision": "Review round 1 found four defects in my own planning surface and all four were fixed rather than rebutted: G-17 named the wrong blocker (H-02 instead of H-03), T-28 carried no dependencies in the machine-readable graph while PLAN.md said it depended on all preceding work, the task count read 26 against an actual 28, and the P3 size split and the totals were wrong. A planning artifact whose own arithmetic is wrong cannot be trusted to gate anything."
    },
